			"notes": "# ArduinoCraft 1.0.1\n## Analog redstone output\nYou can now use something like a potentiometer in real life to control the strength of the redstone signal! View [this example sketch](https://github.com/Lonelywalf/Minecraft-Arduino-1.20.4/tree/master/arduino/example/potentiometer_example) to see how.\n\n## Minor changes\n- The serial communication will now automatically close when exiting the world\n- Updated some of the examples for better readability\n- Some bug fixes"
		},
